OL,6,G     Australia
OL,7,     F...Australia. Dog trainer Graeme
OL,8,     FHall tackles a dog model who
OL,9,     Floudly objects to admirers and
OL,10,     Fphotographers, as well as a
OL,11,     FDachshund who barks, bites and
OL,12,     Fbesieges any cleaning appliance.
OL,13,G0330 Around the World by Train with
OL,14,G     Tony Robinson
OL,15,     FAs he travels across Australia,
OL,16,     FTony visits an outback farm where
OL,17,     Fherding is done by helicopter and
OL,18,     Flearns about the uncertain future
OL,19,     Ffacing the Great Barrier Reef.
